{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb2f32vtYWp8Xr8cYDyH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I implemented the four Shelf rpcs in `shelf.go`, but I haven't run `./check.sh` or the build, so none of it is verified. Bash was denied in this session, so I could only write the file.\n\n- **`AddItem`:** refuses an empty name or a negative quantity with `INVALID_ARGUMENT`, and maps a duplicate name to `ALREADY_EXISTS`. A zero quantity is accepted.\n- **`GetItem` and `RemoveItem`:** both answer `NOT_FOUND` for a missing id.\n- **`ListItems`:** returns every item ordered by id.\n\n`ALREADY_EXISTS` relies on the SQLite error text containing \"UNIQUE\", which I haven't confirmed against `modernc.org/sqlite`.\n\nI added no Go tests, since the project has no test convention."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1601,"cache_read_input_tokens":18554,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1601},"output_tokens":279,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"56992662-8755-4de5-bbdd-29cbbb0f99a3","uuid":"d807fcdc-3c73-499c-8fae-88f8d2584bf4","timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:31:50.470Z","request_id":"req_011Cgb2f2sWqVej6LJwBW44q"}
